{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00604","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大基舞 · 魏徵、褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大基舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猗与祖业，皇矣帝先。\n翦商德厚，封唐庆延。\n在姬犹稷，方晋喻宣。\n基我鼎运，於万斯年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵、褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}